        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dichi enu ana kwetu, nayilembeleli naluwi lwaNzambi, nami, lambulenu nyijimba yenu yili himulambu wawumi, wajila, wakutiyisha nachu Nzambi kuwaha; diwu mudimu wenu waya muma ana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mulondeja mwelaŋawu antu amakonuku; ilaŋa yitoŋojoka yenu yibalumuki kwikala yayiha; kulonda mushinshiki mwaya muchima waNzambi, diwu wawuwahi, watiyishaŋa kuwaha, walala chikupu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naleji antu ejima adi mukachi kenu, naluwi lwananyinkuwu, nami muntu bayi aditoŋojoka kulema kwakubadika mwatelela kutoŋojokaku; Ilaŋa toŋojoki namuchima wawunda, mwayesekela dehi Nzambi antu kukuhwelela wejima wawu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa chitukweti yidi yayivulu mumujimba wumu, niyidi yejima hiyikweti mudimu wowumuku, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "choche nochu nawa etu tudi amavulu tudi mujimba wumu mudi Kristu, twekala chidi chamuntu namukwawu hamuntu hamuntu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Etu chitukweti yamukunkulu yaambuka mwaya luwi lwatwinkeluwu, hela wuprofwetu, tuprofweti mwatwesekelawu kukuhwelela kwetu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hela kumudimu, tushi muchima kumudimu wetu. Muntu mukwakuleja akwawu, ashi muchima kukuleja kwindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu mukwakukonkomwena, ashi muchima kukukonkomwena kwindi. Muntu wahanaŋa, ahani makasa ayedi. Muntu wayulaŋa, ayuli nakashinshi. Muntu welaŋa nyidimu yaluwi, eli nakuseha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kukeŋa kwenu kubuli wufwikŋi. Tiyenu kutama nayuma yatama, kakelenu yuma yayiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiswilenu ayikabishaŋa nkisu; kumina dakukisula nkisu, bayi kushiŋanaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Zaŋalalenu nawakwakuzaŋalala; dilenu nawakwakudila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikalenu nayitoŋojoka yoyimu muntu namukwawu; bayi mudinka wantaku; dikundenu nawantu abula kulema. Bayi muditoŋojoka nenu, yetu tweluka hohuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bayi mwila mwinenu chatama nakatama kanayiliyuku. Keŋenu kwila yuma yalumbwa kumesu awantu ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi chikutwesheka, shakamenu chachiwahi nawantu ejima, mwejima mumukutweshela enu aweni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu akwetu twakeŋa a, bayi muditendaku; kuminenu dakwovwahila kuzuwa, muloŋa anasoneki nawu, Yehova nahoshi nindi, Yami nukutenda, yami nukufweta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neyi chilumbu cheyi natiyi nzala, mwinki yakudya adiyi; neyi natiyi mpwila, mwinki meji anwi; muloŋa neyi mukwila mwenomu, wukumulumbikila makala akesi hanamutu windi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ROM 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kutama bayi kuyimika mushinduku; fwomonenu yatama nayayiwahi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ROM.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ROM.12.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
